{"seconds": 36.9, "exit": 0, "final": "Yes! The white king on h1 is in check from the black pawn on g2. The king cannot escape to g1 (controlled by the pawn), cannot capture the pawn (blocked), and no piece can block or capture on g2. This is checkmate!\n\n**Best move: Nxf3+**\n\n**Main line:** Nxf3+ Kh1 hxg2#\n\n**Motif:** fork (the knight checks the king and forces it where the pawn delivers mate)\n\n**Coaching Note (80 words):**\nWhen your opponent's king lacks escape squares, look for forcing checks that can be followed by mate. Here, your knight on d4 can check the king via f3. White's only response is Kh1 (forced\u2014Kh2 is illegal due to the rook on g8). Then your h3 pawn delivers checkmate on g2 because the king has no escape: g1 is controlled by your pawn, f1 is blocked by White's rook. Always check if a forcing sequence leads to unstoppable mate!\n\n```json\n{\"move\": \"Nxf3+\", \"line\": [\"Nxf3+\", \"Kh1\", \"hxg2#\"], \"motifs\": [\"fork\"]}\n```", "tool_calls": [{"tool": "skill", "args": {"skill": "chess-coach"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-board", "args": {"fen": "2k3rr/Qppbq3/4p3/2Pp1p2/1P1n1N2/3BPN1p/1P3PP1/R4RK1 b - - 0 20"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-threats", "args": {"fen": "2k3rr/Qppbq3/4p3/2Pp1p2/1P1n1N2/3BPN1p/1P3PP1/R4RK1 b - - 0 20"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "2k3rr/Qppbq3/4p3/2Pp1p2/1P1n1N2/3BPN1p/1P3PP1/R4RK1 b - - 0 20", "square": "h8"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "2k3rr/Qppbq3/4p3/2Pp1p2/1P1n1N2/3BPN1p/1P3PP1/R4RK1 b - - 0 20", "square": "g8"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "2k3rr/Qppbq3/4p3/2Pp1p2/1P1n1N2/3BPN1p/1P3PP1/R4RK1 b - - 0 20", "square": "e7"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "2k3rr/Qppbq3/4p3/2Pp1p2/1P1n1N2/3BPN1p/1P3PP1/R4RK1 b - - 0 20", "square": "d4"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-legal_moves", "args": {"fen": "2k3rr/Qppbq3/4p3/2Pp1p2/1P1n1N2/3BPN1p/1P3PP1/R4RK1 b - - 0 20"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "2k3rr/Qppbq3/4p3/2Pp1p